# The prologue's loop (input.c, game/attract_text.h): spectating, the cycle writes "SEGA SATURN
# SH-2" across the floor, the camera panning after it; each word sinks once it's spelt, and
# after the message it jumps back (unseen) and writes it again. A shot every 6 s.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
# Hurry it (any button but START or Z, once: x3), so it lands in about 3 s
press b
wait 3.5
wait 6
shot text_01
wait 6
shot text_02
wait 6
shot text_03
wait 6
shot text_04
wait 6
